---
description: Use the local nl-file-search MCP tools before guessing about indexed files
alwaysApply: true
---

# Local file index

When the user asks to find, search, or recall local notes, images, videos, PDFs, or other files that may be in the nl-file-search index, call `search_files` first. Use `get_file` only with a path returned by search.

Do not invent file contents. Do not dump binary. If the tools fail (empty index, missing `GEMINI_API_KEY`), say so and point them at `nl-search ingest` and `%USERPROFILE%\nl-file-search\.env`.
